OL,3,APotty training scheme to roll out to 20
OL,4,Amore areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of children who were
OL,7,Ftoilet-trained before starting school
OL,8,Fthis year has increased significantly
OL,9,Fin a city where parents were given
OL,10,Fpotty training guides with their first
OL,11,Fschool offers.
OL,13,FYork was the subject of the city-wide
OL,14,Fpilot, which also put on workshops for
OL,15,Fparents and offered special training
OL,16,Ffor early years staff.
OL,18,FTwenty local authorities across England
OL,19,Fare now signed up to launch similar
OL,20,Fschemes to tackle the number of pupils
OL,21,Fstarting school without being fully
OL,22,Ftoilet-trained.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
