OL,3,APotty training scheme to roll out to 20
OL,4,Amore areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the pilot's results
OL,7,Fwere "encouraging", and confirmed they
OL,8,Fwere committed to 75% of pupils
OL,9,Freaching a good level of development at
OL,10,Fthe end of their first year in school
OL,11,Fby 2028.
